usecase-beta
accTitle: Library lending
accDescr: Members borrow and return books.
direction LR
actor Member
actor Librarian@{ type: hollow }
systemBoundary Library[Library system]
  Borrow(Borrow a book)
  Return(Return a book)
  Fine[Pay a fine]
end
Member -- requests --> Borrow
Member --> Return
Librarian --o Fine
Return ..>: include Fine
Borrow --|> Return
note for Borrow "Max 5 books per member"
classDef critical fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
class Fine critical
style Member fill:#eef
